        <paragraph>Answers will vary. Examples: $$a 1 =800, a n =0.5a n-1 a 1 =800, a n =0.5a n-1$$ and $$a 1 =12.5, a n =4a n-1 a 1 =12.5, a n =4a n-1$$</paragraph>
